OL,3,AHarry says it's 'great to be back in
OL,4,ANottingham' as he and Meghan tour
OL,5,Acharities after UK return
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex are met
OL,8,Fwith cheers and shouts of "I love you"
OL,9,Fas they tour Nottingham on their first
OL,10,Froyal-style joint engagement since
OL,11,Freturning to the UK
OL,13,FHarry and Meghan are visiting Epic
OL,14,FPartners, a youth charity in the suburb
OL,15,Fof Sneinton, and the third stop on
OL,16,Ftheir visit - "I've always wanted to
OL,17,Fmeet them," flower-bearing fan Dean
OL,18,FMackenzie says outside
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
